{
  "_comment": "TowerDef3D GAME rules (ADR 0009 Phase 3b). Wave timer + spawn pacing, wave promotion, tower build/upgrade input handlers, lives-lost when enemy reaches base.",
  "rules": [
    {
      "_comment": "=== CLOCK + WAVES === spawn_cooldown ticks always (drives the spawn cadence within a wave). wave_timer ticks ONLY between waves (enemies_alive \u2264 0 AND enemies_to_spawn \u2264 0) \u2014 otherwise it would go negative while enemies are still walking and HUD would show 'Next wave in: -3s'.",
      "id": "clock_advance_spawn_cooldown",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "tick",
        "interval": 1
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "wave_clock"
        ]
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "spawn_cooldown",
          "amount": -0.1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_": "wave_timer ticks once the current wave is done SPAWNING (ets\u22640). Doesn't wait for enemies to die \u2014 by design, waves overlap to ramp pressure.",
      "id": "clock_advance_wave_timer",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "tick",
        "interval": 1
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "wave_clock"
        ],
        "state": {
          "enemies_to_spawn_lte": 0
        }
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "wave_timer",
          "amount": -0.1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Advance to next wave when timer \u2264 0 AND no pending spawns. Doesn't wait for current wave's enemies to die \u2014 overlapping waves ramp difficulty (player must build/upgrade fast enough to handle multiple waves on field).",
      "id": "wave_advance",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "tick",
        "interval": 1
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "wave_clock"
        ],
        "state": {
          "wave_timer_lte": 0.0,
          "enemies_to_spawn_lte": 0
        }
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "wave",
          "amount": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "state_set",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "enemies_to_spawn",
          "value": "self.state.wave * 2 + 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "state_set",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "wave_timer",
          "value": 8.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Spawn one enemy per spawn_cooldown tick. Increment enemies_alive (decremented on death/leak \u2014 drives wave_advance gate). 80% imp; the 20% demon path is the wave_promote_to_demon rule that fires on spawn-trigger.",
      "id": "wave_spawn_one",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "tick",
        "interval": 1
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "wave_clock"
        ],
        "state": {
          "spawn_cooldown_lte": 0.0,
          "enemies_to_spawn_gt": 0
        }
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "template": "enemy_grunt",
          "position": [
            -9,
            0,
            -7
          ],
          "overrides": {
            "state": {
              "velocity": [
                2.0,
                0,
                0
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "enemies_to_spawn",
          "amount": -1
        },
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "enemies_alive",
          "amount": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "state_set",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "spawn_cooldown",
          "value": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "20% chance: just-spawned grunt becomes a demon (slower, tankier). Spawn-trigger fires synchronously after spawn effect commits; query 'grunt' tag matches the new entity.",
      "id": "wave_promote_to_demon",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "spawn"
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "grunt"
        ]
      },
      "chance": 0.2,
      "effect": {
        "type": "transform",
        "target": "self",
        "to": "enemy_demon"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "=== PLAYER BUILDS \u2014 press 1/2/3/4 to drop a basic tower. Slot levels: 0=ghost, 1=basic, 2=advanced. Build only fires when slot is at level 0 (ghost still present).",
      "id": "build_slot_1",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "input",
        "action": "build_1"
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "player"
        ],
        "state": {
          "gold_gte": 50,
          "slot_1_level_lte": 0
        }
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "template": "tower_basic",
          "overrides": {
            "_forced_id": "tower_1"
          },
          "position": [
            -6,
            0,
            -4
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "remove",
          "target": "ghost_1"
        },
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "gold",
          "amount": -50
        },
        {
          "type": "emit_shell_event",
          "event": "play_sound",
          "name": "build"
        },
        {
          "type": "state_set",
          "target": "self",
          "field": "slot_1_level",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    },
